# Code owners. With the candidate/a ruleset's code-owner review, a PR that changes any
# path below cannot merge without an approval from @XThoughtLabs, the CEO's account.
# It covers every path the gate protects (gate.guard G-1, G-1a, G-1b, and quality.toml's
# [guard] lists), and every path the guard marks for a person in needs_code_owner
# (G-1b-mark, G-1c, G-4a, G-8), so that a mark binds a person and not only a comment.
# GitHub matches these paths in their exact letter case; the guard matches any case.

# Gate control: G-1 and quality.toml extra_protected.
/.github/                 @XThoughtLabs
/acceptance/              @XThoughtLabs
/quality.toml             @XThoughtLabs
/CODEOWNERS               @XThoughtLabs
/SPEC.md                  @XThoughtLabs
/TASK.md                  @XThoughtLabs
/BASELINE.md              @XThoughtLabs
/OPEN-ISSUES.md           @XThoughtLabs
/SOURCE-MANIFEST.json     @XThoughtLabs
/evidence/                @XThoughtLabs
/security-review.md       @XThoughtLabs
/prompts/                 @XThoughtLabs
/.claude/                 @XThoughtLabs
/.mcp.json                @XThoughtLabs

# What controls the tests and the security tools, in any folder: G-1a.
pytest.ini                @XThoughtLabs
.pytest.ini               @XThoughtLabs
pytest.toml               @XThoughtLabs
.pytest.toml              @XThoughtLabs
.bandit                   @XThoughtLabs
bandit.yaml               @XThoughtLabs
bandit.yml                @XThoughtLabs
.gitleaks.toml            @XThoughtLabs
.gitleaksignore           @XThoughtLabs
.gitattributes            @XThoughtLabs
/pytest.py                @XThoughtLabs
/pytest/                  @XThoughtLabs
/_pytest/                 @XThoughtLabs

# Configuration files read by pytest, coverage and the security tools, in any folder: G-1b, G-1b-mark.
pyproject.toml            @XThoughtLabs
setup.cfg                 @XThoughtLabs
tox.ini                   @XThoughtLabs
.coveragerc               @XThoughtLabs

# Every conftest.py, the root one included: G-1a, G-1c.
conftest.py               @XThoughtLabs

# Tests: G-2 to G-4a.
tests/                    @XThoughtLabs
test_*.py                 @XThoughtLabs
*_test.py                 @XThoughtLabs

# Dependencies: G-7, G-8.
/requirements.lock        @XThoughtLabs
/requirements.in          @XThoughtLabs
